{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47283","headline":"游仙二十四首 二十 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 二十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬盖造辰极，乘烟游阆风。\n上元降玉闼，王母开琳宫。\n天人何济济，高会碧堂中。\n列侍奏云歌，真音满太空。\n千年紫柰熟，四劫灵瓜丰。\n斯乐异荒讌，陶陶殊未终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}